      "title": "Research Associate - Department of Immunology and Immunotherapy - 107894 - Grade 6",
      "description": "To assist in research (by carrying out data collection or analyses) to create knowledge through providing research support for projects and research groups. The candidate will work within an internationally renowned type 1 diabetes immunology group and will manage and maintain murine breeding colonies and lead in performing murine immunology studies.\n\nPosting closes: 2026-09-14",
