      "description": "We are seeking a highly motivated Postdoctoral Research Associate (PDRA) to join the Schnepp Research Group on an industry funded project. The project will involve the synthesis and characterization of carbon/iron carbide materials for applications in electromagnetic attenuation.\n\nThis position is available on a fixed-term basis for 12 months, with the possibility of extension subject to the availability of further funding.\n\nPosting closes: 2026-09-17",
